{"code":0,"data":{"job_post_detail":{"id":"7669721161882667317","title":"游戏技术美术工程师 - Glow Studio","description":"团队介绍：Glow Studio 微光工作室，寓意是照亮梦想、创造快乐。目前的产品是PVP和ARPG品类，后续倾向于在轻竞技和动作竞技上继续尝试。我们的产品理念是：聚焦、积累和创新。未来期望能创造激情游戏，连接数亿玩家，欢迎加入我们。\n\n1、负责游戏引擎开发和管线建设；\n2、负责渲染效果开发和性能优化；\n3、负责产品需求开发和工具建设。","requirement":"1、2027届获得本科及以上学历，计算机等相关专业优先；\n2、熟练掌握C/C++/Python等至少一门语言；\n3、具备出色的编码能力，扎实的数学和图形学功底；\n4、学习能力强，能够独立分析和解决复杂问题；\n5、积极主动，高效沟通，具备团队精神。\n\n加分项\n1、热爱游戏，有实习经验，参加过Game Jam；\n2、在ACM/ICPC等编程比赛中斩获过奖项；\n3、熟悉Unity或Unreal引擎，自己动手制作过游戏；\n4、有学术研究经验，发表过图形学会议或期刊论文。","job_category":{"id":"6704215957146962184","name":"客户端","en_name":"Client","i18n_name":"客户端","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"6704215862603155720","name":"研发","en_name":"R\u0026D","i18n_name":"研发","depth":1,"children":[]},"children":[]},"city_info":{"code":"CT_45","name":"广州","en_name":"Guangzhou","i18n_name":"广州"},"recruit_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"publish_time":1785746136606,"channel_online_status":1,"job_subject":{"id":"7649336829398468869","name":{"zh_cn":"2027届校园招聘","i18n":"2027届校园招聘"},"active_status":1},"code":"A149007A","job_id":"7660827754776316165","city_list":[{"code":"CT_45","name":"广州","en_name":"Guangzhou","location_type":3,"i18n_name":"广州","py_name":"guangzhou","mdm_code":"MDCY00000247","node_status":1}],"job_post_info":{"recruitment_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"HighlightList":[],"JobChannelPublishList":[],"job_post_object_value_map":{},"address_list":[],"city_list":[],"correlation_job_list":[],"tag_list":[],"storefront_list":[],"target_major_list":[],"job_post_process_ti